# Build output
bin/
obj/
publish/

# The published executable is regenerated by the README command, not committed.
/LocalCloudRelay.exe

# Test output. `dotnet test` writes TestResults/ by default, and the XML it emits
# embeds absolute local paths and the machine name.
TestResults/
*.coverage
coverage*.xml
coverage*.json

# Agent local state
.claude/
.devin/

# IDE
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo

# OS
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Secrets / runtime settings.
# The app writes these to %LOCALAPPDATA%\LocalCloudRelay, outside the repository
# entirely, so nothing can reach a commit even without this rule. Belt and braces.
*.dat

# Old / archived files. Everything here is untracked history kept on disk rather than
# deleted: earlier app names and exes, design mockups, superseded screenshots, the
# internal build plan and client-setup walkthrough, and the current published build.
# Nothing here is referenced by the solution, the build or the README. README.md is
# the only document this repository ships.

# Internal planning notes and agent session state: kept on disk, not published.
PLAN.md
docs/freeze-audit.md
.remember/
.superpowers/
